  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Statistics IV - Contract SCB</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">National Statistics IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbetet mellan National Statistical Centre, NSC och SCB har p&#xe5;g&#xe5;tt mer &#xe4;n 10 &#xe5;r och &#xe4;r nu inne i sin 4:e fas. Projektet syftar till att f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rka den nationella statistikproduktionen, fr&#xe4;mst p&#xe5; det socio-ekonomiska omr&#xe5;det, kvalitet, metoder infrastruktur. Det omfattar institutionellt st&#xf6;d och kapacitetsuppbyggnad f&#xf6;r att skapa en central statistikbyr&#xe5;. St&#xf6;det uppg&#xe5;r till 35,5 mkr 2001-2004.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The cooperation between National Statistical Centre, NSC, and Swedish Statistics started more than 10 years ago. The fourth phase of cooperation 2001-2004 amounts to 35,5 MSEK and includes strengthening quality and production of socio-economic statistics and infrastrucure as well as institional strengthening and capacity building to make NSC the major body for monitoring statistical activities in Laos.</narrative>
  </description>
